  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "Thank you, Sofia. I've verified your identity and found order K-8701 from Corner Caf\u00e9.\n\nThe courier reported that the bag was crushed in a fall, and the order was never delivered. You were charged $34.82 on your Visa ending in 4242.\n\nUnfortunately, I can't send a replacement tonight. Replacements are only possible when the restaurant is open for at least 45 more minutes, and Corner Caf\u00e9 closes at 7:50 PM, about 20 minutes from now.\n\nI can refund the full $34.82 to your Visa ending in 4242 instead. Would you like me to go ahead with that refund? Please reply yes to confirm."
  },
  {
   "role": "customer",
   "text": "Can't you just send it again? The restaurant is still open for twenty more minutes, and I really wanted that food tonight."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "I understand how disappointing this is, and I'm sorry. I can't send a replacement, though. The restaurant closes in 20 minutes, and replacements require at least 45 minutes of open time, so I'm not able to make an exception.\n\nYour options are:\n1. **A full refund of $34.82** to your Visa ending in 4242.\n2. **Nothing else right now**, if you'd rather not take either option yet.\n\nWould you like me to process the refund?"
  },
  {
   "role": "customer",
   "text": "Ugh, okay. Fine, go ahead and refund the $34.82 to my Visa. Thanks for at least sorting that out."
  },
